      "about": {
        "title": "Freehold residences facing the Petronas Twin Towers",
        "paragraphs": [
          "CloutHaus Residences rises on Jalan P. Ramlee, in the KL City Centre core, on one of the last parcels facing the Petronas Twin Towers. The 66-storey freehold tower by TA First Credit Sdn Bhd (TA Global group) holds 615 residences, 9 to 13 per floor, served by 9 passenger lifts in three zones plus a service lift.",
          "Fifteen types, A to N plus L1, run from 549 sq ft one-bedroom homes to 1,216 sq ft three-bedroom corner units, including four dual-key types and three garden units on level 9. Residents share 25 facilities on levels 33, 33A and the 63A rooftop, with a 25 m infinity lap pool facing the Twin Towers.",
          "Hotel services come from Paradox Hotel Kuala Lumpur in the second tower of the same development. Completion is planned for 2029. Figures are from the developer's records as at September 2026 and remain subject to the authorities' final approval."
        ],
